# The installer's library is server-side source, all of it: PHP manifests, page
# templates, stylesheets and bundled font sources, read by the wizard and
# copied into the project by it. Nothing in here is ever served directly.
# Up to Nino 1.1 there was one exception - the theme picker's preview images,
# which went with the themes when the wizard stopped asking about the look.
Require all denied

Options -Indexes
